imes, she really just can’t become honest when it comes to her feelings for Yuma. Known as “imouto-sama” amongst the residents."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Warum's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1528"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/2172387ed4860acaeb206cf2919e5aba924853b4463161366a600bed290651b3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ec7175550b1cc241668122fa3734098db8fb5babe5d5971a2cdc1c8650ecbd56.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"みる","creatorId":"vndb:s364","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s364","name":"壱智村 小真","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:33688","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1529","characterName":"橘 花珠","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1529"},"originalCharacterName":"橘 花珠","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The long lost osananajimi (maybe) that has amnesia. Self-proclaimed “reliable oneesan” of the family but despite the long silky black hair she is a natural klutz. Favorite items being healthy foods, there are times when the dorm’s kitchen may have seen better days. In a few words: slow, my pace, and assets."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Warum's review"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real identity is Tachibana Fuwari (橘 ふわり). Having lost her memory, she only remembered the name of \"Kaju\" and the role of \"onee-chan\" and she rebuilt her personality with these elements."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1529"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94fa0d2cd21371cd7fcf702edadb8fdc978bd55dd31f3c2cd093b11dd5ea9190.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b9031e78fd112322c192008c0824d7106ded21bc1147817302c2272697025fde.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"有栖川 みや美","creatorId":"vndb:s363","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s363","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s363","name":"高田 初美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:33687","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1530","characterName":"天羽 ちよこ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1530"},"originalCharacterName":"天羽 ちよこ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Self proclaimed high tension mascot character of the dorm, Choko is the eccentric moodmaker of the group and has a wide range of hobbies. She is as random as she is bipolar, dropping hobbies as fast as CB players drop tears on their gararolls, recently got into making haikus."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Warum's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1530"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/79446dc31f49067441d342884856d3590f01ecd6561f0e34281eee15aa668f4b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/ca7f4e578e055f4b34ce10c56855cd930459c8d48b8887662759253e0054ded1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"雪都 さお梨","creatorId":"vndb:s607","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s607","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s607","name":"深田 愛衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:33693","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1531","characterName":"春日井 優真","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1531"},"originalCharacterName":"春日井 優真","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of the story, a sophomore. Looks cold and aloof, but is actually the opposite and takes care of his friends. While seemingly collected, at times he will naturally say perverted things. Quite the siscon."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Warum's Review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1531"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/be/be080a909a6d0362c2b840adf52917718f51787567277a5989765281368b818d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2a425dff1fefcd59fa316b63619ce2f24e539671c018c8600b697c9e16ba4450.webp","width":189,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1532","characterName":"鈴","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1532"},"originalCharacterName":"鈴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The emotionless and quiet girl of mysteries, one who guided Yuma and Sakura when they first arrived at Sakurano. Wearing a red kimono coupled with the small bell earrings, she fits the description of the god in the rumor of “making lies true”…"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Warum's review"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In the post-apocalyptic world, Rin had not yet awakened her powers and she relied a lot on \"Nii-san\" whom she admired enormously and who introduced her to reading. Rin has learned a lot in her reading (It is through her reading that she learns to like cherry trees), especially about emotions (something she never expresses) and especially about something she does not understand: love."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Wanting to discover this feeling, she will ask her Nii-san several times to kiss her and she realizes pretty quickly that she is in love with him. However, their peaceful life quickly ends, robots attack them and her brother is fatally injured during the fight against the machines. Succeeding their escape, Nii-san takes Rin safely and begins to die in front of her eyes. Sad and suffering enormously, she awakens her power and creates a new temporality where her brother can live happily ever after, as in his stories."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is currently reincarnated in the person of Sakura."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1532"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9bec6647a4d34d320276155fde6b4383062be110f173c3d5cb2696179914a891.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2b/2bc758367383a149475e20431afacdbe8d27fa007b3ee077b8dbe9230da5ac6c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"笹川 綺雪","creatorId":"vndb:s1648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1648","name":"中村 繪里子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:33694","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c67853","characterName":"結城 音々","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c67853"},"originalCharacterName":"結城 音々","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yuuma's homeroom teacher who teaches modern languages and is also the dorm manager. Nene hates being treated like a kid, but acts and looks like one. Her favorite food is hamburger steak, and she dislikes both carrots and bell peppers. Also owns a cat despite having a cat allergy."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67853"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bbd7de80a5e5a1493c759536e10442faee4b2c07cff324f8300f1d6affc2142b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/478b2c448fc5e38437a6e51bd963a8edb1566887054e31f962c7a4e0dabdfa19.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"奏雨","creatorId":"vndb:s199","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s199","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s199","name":"尾崎 真実","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:33686","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c67856","characterName":"早乙女 霞","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c67856"},"originalCharacterName":"早乙女 霞","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A very feminine-looking guy who lives at the Sakurano Dorm. Where Chiyoko is the moodmaker, Kasumi is the peacemaker of the dorm. He is also somewhat shy."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67856"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d016844aa012b180721bb8a35208654f028dcac384f816f05b66e6a5cff4d81e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/78c58b29c361a932a5370e654df70148ed8